@startuml Sequence Diagram - Gestionare Caz Urgență

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 20
skinparam maxMessageSize 60

title Diagramă Secvență - Gestionare Caz Urgență

actor "Medic" as Doctor
participant "Frontend\nEmergency Dashboard" as Frontend
participant "API Route\n/app/api/emergency" as API
participant "Emergency Helpers" as Helpers
database "SQLite\nDatabase" as Database
participant "State Machine\nValidator" as Validator

== Creare Caz Urgență ==
Doctor -> Frontend: Accesează pagina /admin/emergency/new
Frontend -> Frontend: Încarcă lista pacienți

Doctor -> Frontend: Selectează pacient
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează chiefComplaint
Doctor -> Frontend: Selectează triageLevel
Doctor -> Frontend: Submit formular

Frontend -> API: POST /api/emergency\n{patientId, triageLevel, chiefComplaint}
API -> Helpers: createEmergencyCase(params)
Helpers -> Database: INSERT INTO emergency_cases\n(state: 'arrival')
Database --> Helpers: caseId
Helpers -> Database: INSERT INTO emergency_state_transitions\n(from: null, to: 'arrival')
Database --> Helpers: transitionId
Helpers --> API: EmergencyCase object
API --> Frontend: 200 OK\n{caseId, success: true}

== Tranziție Stare: Arrival -> Triage ==
Doctor -> Frontend: Click pe caz în Kanban
Frontend -> API: GET /api/emergency/[caseId]
API -> Helpers: getById(caseId)
Helpers -> Database: SELECT * FROM emergency_cases
Database --> Helpers: case data
Helpers --> API: EmergencyCase
API --> Frontend: Case details

Doctor -> Frontend: Completează formular triaj
Doctor -> Frontend: Introducere vital signs
Doctor -> Frontend: Setează priority
Doctor -> Frontend: Submit

Frontend -> API: POST /api/emergency/[caseId]/triage\n{vitalSigns, priority}
API -> Validator: validateTransition(\ncurrentState: 'arrival',\nnewState: 'triage')
Validator --> API: Valid

API -> Helpers: updateState(caseId, 'triage')
Helpers -> Database: UPDATE emergency_cases\nSET currentState = 'triage',\ntriageTime = NOW()
Database --> Helpers: Success
Helpers -> Database: INSERT INTO emergency_state_transitions\n(from: 'arrival', to: 'triage')
Database --> Helpers: transitionId
Helpers --> API: Updated case
API --> Frontend: 200 OK

== Tranziție Stare: Triage -> Consent ==
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează formular consimțământ
Doctor -> Frontend: Bifează consentGiven
Doctor -> Frontend: Introducere signedBy
Doctor -> Frontend: Submit

Frontend -> API: POST /api/emergency/[caseId]/consent\n{consentGiven: true, signedBy}
API -> Validator: validateTransition(\ncurrentState: 'triage',\nnewState: 'consent')
Validator --> API: Valid

API -> Helpers: updateState(caseId, 'consent')
Helpers -> Database: UPDATE emergency_cases\nSET currentState = 'consent',\nconsentGiven = 1
Database --> Helpers: Success
Helpers -> Database: INSERT INTO emergency_state_transitions
Database --> Helpers: transitionId
Helpers --> API: Updated case
API --> Frontend: 200 OK

== Tranziție Stare: Consent -> Admission ==
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează plan îngrijire
Doctor -> Frontend: Submit

Frontend -> API: POST /api/emergency/[caseId]/care-plan\n{carePlan}
API -> Validator: validateTransition(\ncurrentState: 'consent',\nnewState: 'admission')
Validator --> API: Valid

API -> Helpers: updateState(caseId, 'admission')
Helpers -> Database: UPDATE emergency_cases\nSET currentState = 'admission',\nadmissionTime = NOW(),\ncarePlan = ?
Database --> Helpers: Success
Helpers --> API: Updated case
API --> Frontend: 200 OK

== Tranziție Stare: Admission -> Treatment ==
Doctor -> Frontend: Click "Începe Tratament"
Frontend -> API: POST /api/emergency/[caseId]/transition\n{toState: 'treatment'}
API -> Validator: validateTransition(\ncurrentState: 'admission',\nnewState: 'treatment')
Validator --> API: Valid

API -> Helpers: updateState(caseId, 'treatment')
Helpers -> Database: UPDATE emergency_cases\nSET currentState = 'treatment'
Database --> Helpers: Success
Helpers --> API: Updated case
API --> Frontend: 200 OK

== Tranziție Stare: Treatment -> Discharge ==
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează scrisoare externare
Doctor -> Frontend: Submit

Frontend -> API: POST /api/emergency/[caseId]/discharge\n{dischargeLetter}
API -> Validator: validateTransition(\ncurrentState: 'treatment',\nnewState: 'discharge')
Validator --> API: Valid

API -> Helpers: updateState(caseId, 'discharge')
Helpers -> Database: UPDATE emergency_cases\nSET currentState = 'discharge',\ndischargeTime = NOW(),\ndischargeLetter = ?
Database --> Helpers: Success
Helpers --> API: Updated case
API --> Frontend: 200 OK

Frontend -> Frontend: Actualizează Kanban board
Frontend -> Doctor: Afișează caz în coloana "Externare"

@enduml
